@startuml
' Gallery: components in nested containers, a database, a queue, link styles, and stereotypes
title Order services
package "Front end" {
  [Web shop] as Web
  [Mobile app] as Mobile
}
node "Application server" {
  component Orders <<service>>
  component Billing <<service>>
  queue Events
}
database "Order store" as Store
Web --> Orders : REST
Mobile --> Orders : REST
Orders ..> Events : publish
Events ..> Billing : consume
Orders --> Store
Billing ==> Store : nightly
@enduml
